# Power Platform Guidelines

## MCP Servers Available

- `user-power-apps` - Power Apps/Dataverse
- `user-sharepoint` - SharePoint integration

## Power Apps Patterns

### Dataverse Queries

Use OData query syntax for filtering and selecting data.

### Common Operations

- List environments
- Query Dataverse tables
- Create/update records

## SharePoint Integration

### File Operations

```
sp_list_folder → Browse structure
sp_read_file → Get content
sp_write_file → Upload/update
sp_search → Find content
```

### List Operations

```
sp_list_lists → Get all lists
sp_query_list → Query list items
```

## Best Practices

- Use minimal queries - request only needed fields
- Paginate large result sets
- Handle throttling gracefully
- Cache repeated lookups when possible
